on, 22 Jun 2026 13:28:17 GMT</pubDate><author>淡1685</author></item><item><title>#飞牛私有云fnOS# 手机上一打开飞牛 APP，就会马上唤醒已经休眠的机械硬盘，但是如果通过电脑浏览器网页访问后台的话，就不会唤醒机械硬盘😓</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coolapk.com/t/%E9%A3%9E%E7%89%9B%E7%A7%81%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%91fnOS?type=0&quot;&gt;#飞牛私有云fnOS#&lt;/a&gt;  手机上一打开飞牛 APP，就会马上唤醒已经休眠的机械硬盘，但是如果通过电脑浏览器网页访问后台的话，就不会唤醒机械硬盘😓&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://www.coolapk.com/feed/72476584</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.coolapk.com/feed/72476584</guid><pubDate>Mon, 22 Jun 2026 12:49:17 GMT</pubDate><author>smileplaytime</author></item><item><title>#NAS# #机械硬盘# #飞牛私有云fnOS# 什么意思，可以买吗？</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coolapk.com/t/NAS?type=0&quot;&gt;#NAS#&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coolapk.com/t/%E6%9C%BA%E6%A2%B0%E7%A1%AC%E7%9B%98?type=0&quot;&gt;#机械硬盘#&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coolapk.com/t/%E9%A3%9E%E7%89%9B%E7%A7%81%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%91fnOS?type=0&quot;&gt;#飞牛私有云fnOS#&lt;/a&gt; 什么意思，可以买吗？&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/52211369dff2a38a2c1e5dd137666ef3.jpg&quot; &gt;</description><link>https://www.coolapk.com/feed/72473146</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.coolapk.com/feed/72473146</guid><pubDate>Mon, 22 Jun 2026 08:55:40 GMT</pubDate><author>虚洲</author></item><item><title>#飞牛私有云fnOS# N5105 8+256出一个</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coolapk.com/t/%E9%A3%9E%E7%89%9B%E7%A7%81%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%91fnOS?type=0&quot;&gt;#飞牛私有云fnOS#&lt;/a&gt;
